WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
I will definitely come back and skin you before we leave.

2
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:07,980
Confused, nephew

3
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,180
Even if we risk our lives

4
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:10,500
I can't use this method of survival

5
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,380
Just give it to them for free, now that's fine

6
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:14,580
From now on, anyone can catch rabbits for our meat.

7
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:15,660
Isn’t it less?

8
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:16,620
Too abominable

9
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,820
Fighting for a few rabbits

10
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:18,980
Not worth my understanding

11
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,220
But it was just given to them for nothing

12
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:21,580
I feel so panicked

13
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:24,500
let them eat

14
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:27,700
Because I originally planned not to let them understand this method.

15
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:29,880
Just a piece of rabbit meat won't save your life

16
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:32,500
Wait until they get sick and have no choice but to

17
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:34,060
Only then will you truly understand

18
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:35,780
Who can lead them?

19
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:36,820
people who survive

20
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:39,220
It won't take half a month just to eat this pure lean rabbit meat.

21
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:40,580
One by one they will

22
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,680
I was so happy that I couldn’t stand up when the time came

23
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,440
Diaoya, Diaoya bleeds, bleeds

24
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:46,440
Diaoya Bleeding Nephew

25
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:48,200
The more you say this, the more scary it becomes.

26
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,440
How can you eat people like that?

27
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:51,160
Secrets cannot be kept secret
